      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d627106a6f211386af23bfe|full_name}: for immediate cases, they recommend reporting them to moderation@vrchat.com as a report button in game wont do much other than knock them down a rank possibly and they would need proof they are hacking. The in game report is for minor things like someone being annoying.",
